Here is an upgraded, zero-dependency, single-file 3D voxel adventure game (index.html) ready to push directly to GitHub and run via GitHub Pages.
What's New in this Version:
 * True Voxel Raycasting (DDA / Voxel Traversal): Fast, precise block destruction and placement without mesh tearing.
 * Singapore Primary 4 Normal Chinese (普通华文) Progression: 3 fully realized levels with unique voxel palettes, Singapore-themed biomes, and MOE Huan Le Huo Ban (《欢乐伙伴》) syllabus checkpoints.
 * Radical & Pinyin Tooltips: Displays character components and Hanyu Pinyin with tone marks.
 * Audio Synthesis: Uses the Web Audio API for 8-bit sound effects (jump, mine, place block, victory chime, error thud) without external audio file dependencies.
 * In-Game Pause/Settings Menu (ESC/P): Clean transition out of Pointer Lock so questions and controls never freeze.
